cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Aptuni in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Aptuni: a local-first personal context layer for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Aptuni gives AI agents the right personal context without giving them everything about the
  user. It keeps an open-format Profile Vault as the source of truth, turns user-approved sources
  into minimized evidence, and serves budgeted, permission-checked context to agents over MCP.
type: software
authors:
